<title>UK: Triplex Lloyd extends offer for Wm. Cook.</title>
<headline>Triplex Lloyd extends offer for Wm. Cook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Triplex Lloyd Plc said on Monday it had received acceptances for about 5.67 percent of steel firm William Cook Plc's ordinary share capital by the end of last week.</p>
<p>Triplex also extended its hostile bid for William Cook to 1500 GMT on December 31.</p>
</text>
